    "   The overall mean absolute timing error is $0.0214\\,\\text{s}$ ($21.4\\,\\text{ms}$) with a dataset mean percentage error of $1.5243\\%$, which aligns with expected human visual-auditory stopwatch reaction latencies ($20 - 40\\,\\text{ms}$).\n",
